<view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在准备学习内容…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="page"><view class="card error-card">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view></view><view wx:else class="learn-page"><view class="video-wrap"><video wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{!videoError}}" id="lesson-video-{{item.id}}" data-session="{{item.id}}" src="{{item.url}}" initial-time="{{item.startTime}}" title="{{item.title}}" controls enable-play-gesture show-mute-btn enable-progress-gesture object-fit="contain" bindtimeupdate="timeUpdate" bindpause="pause" bindended="ended" binderror="videoFailed"/><view wx:if="{{videoError}}" class="video-error"><text>视频加载失败，请检查网络后重试</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="retryVideo">重新获取视频</button></view></view><view class="page learn-content"><view wx:if="{{demoVideo}}" class="notice demo-video">当前播放的是演示视频，用于验证播放与进度功能。</view><view wx:if="{{isPreview}}" class="notice">你正在试看本课时。加入课程后可保存进度、学习全部课时并下载讲义。</view><view class="now-learning"><view class="eyebrow">NOW LEARNING</view><view class="lesson-name">{{lesson.title}}</view><view class="course-name">{{course.title}}</view><view class="save-status"><view class="pill-dot"></view>{{savedText}}</view></view><view class="learn-actions"><button class="ghost" bindtap="materials">▤ 课程讲义</button><button wx:if="{{nextLesson}}" class="secondary" bindtap="next">下一课 →</button><button wx:elif="{{isPreview}}" class="primary" bindtap="buy">加入课程</button></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">课程目录</view><text class="small muted">{{lessons.length}} 节课时</text></view><view class="lesson-list card"><view wx:for="{{lessons}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseLesson" class="list-row {{lesson.id === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}"><view class="list-number">{{lesson.id === item.id ? '▶' : item.completed ? '✓' : item.number}}</view><view class="list-info"><view>{{item.title}}</view><text>{{item.durationText}} <text wx:if="{{item.isPreview}}"> · 可试看</text><text wx:if="{{item.completed}}"> · 已学完</text></text></view><view class="list-current" wx:if="{{lesson.id === item.id}}">学习中</view><view class="list-lock" wx:elif="{{!course.canWatch && !item.isPreview}}">›</view></view></view><view class="learn-footer">专注这一课，收获下一步 <text>✦</text></view></view></view>
